      "comment": "MANGO BEACH (1) is still a maiden after 26 runs but rarely far away, the latest filling a minor placing when second at Q Straight. Makes plenty of appeal. ALL BARK (7) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (20.58) behind Jakari Britt at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Will give a great sight again. MIDNIGHT MONICA (4) comes off an average run last start when fifth at Q Parklands over 520m behind Rogue Bandit (30.59) in a Maiden. Has ability and can atone. MY PEARL (2) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
